<p> -				     Q1-A-----Q4-----Q3---1996</p>
<p> Gross Domestic Product	   5.6    3.8    2.1    2.4</p>
<p> Final Sales of Domest.Product  3.9    4.9    0.5    2.7</p>
<p> Final Sales to Domestic Buyers 5.6    2.6    1.7    2.8</p>
<p> GDP Price Index		    2.7    1.9    2.0    2.1</p>
<p> Implicit Price Deflator	  2.3    1.5    1.7    2.0</p>
<p> Consumer Spending		  6.4    3.4    0.5    2.5</p>
